"through using a module)"
msgstr "$OMP 要求指定了 %<atomic_default_mem_order(%s)%> 子句，而这会覆盖 %L 处的设置呢，杂鱼"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:7666
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP REQUIRES clause %<atomic_default_mem_order(%s)%> specified via module "
"%qs use at %L but same clause is not specified for the program unit"
msgstr "$OMP 要求通过模块 %qs 指定 %<atomic_default_mem_order(%s)%> 子句呢，"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:7671
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP REQUIRES clause %qs specified via module %qs use at %L but same clause"
" is not specified for the program unit"
msgstr "$OMP 要求指定通过模块 %qs 使用的条款在 %L 处，但是同样的条款是……这都不懂吗，杂鱼"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:7786
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Expected ACQ_REL, ACQUIRE, RELAXED, RELEASE or SEQ_CST for "
"ATOMIC_DEFAULT_MEM_ORDER clause at %C"
msgstr "对于 `ATOMIC_DEFAULT_MEM_OR`，期望的是 `ACQ_REL`, `ACQUIRE`, `RELAXED`, `RELEASE` 或 `SEQ_"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:7811
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Expected UNIFIED_ADDRESS, UNIFIED_SHARED_MEMORY, SELF_MAPS, "
"DYNAMIC_ALLOCATORS, REVERSE_OFFLOAD, or ATOMIC_DEFAULT_MEM_ORDER clause at "
"%L"
msgstr "期望的是UNIFIED_ADDRESS, UNIFIED_SHARED_MEMORY, SELF_MAPS, DYNAMIC_ALLOCATORS，杂鱼，这都不懂吗"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8217 fortran/openmp.cc:8220 fortran/openmp.cc:8223
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "!$OMP ATOMIC at %L with %s clause is incompatible with READ or WRITE"
msgstr "$OMP 原子操作在 %L 处使用 %s 子句与 READ 或 WRITE 不兼容哦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8227
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "!$OMP ATOMIC at %L with %s clause requires %s clause"
msgstr "这个`$OMP ATOMIC`在`%L`处使用`%s`子句，要求`%s`子句呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8257
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP ATOMIC WRITE at %L incompatible with ACQUIRES clause implicitly "
"provided by a REQUIRES directive"
msgstr "`!$OMP ATOMIC WRITE` 在 `%L` 处与隐式提供的 `ACQUIRES` 子句不兼容呀，杂鱼。这都不懂吗。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8268
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP ATOMIC READ at %L incompatible with RELEASE clause implicitly provided"
" by a REQUIRES directive"
msgstr "`$OMP` 的原子读取在 %L 处与隐式提供的 `RELEASE` 子句不兼容啦，这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8286
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "!$OMP ATOMIC READ at %L incompatible with RELEASE clause"
msgstr "!$OMP 原子读取在 %L 处与 RELEASE 子句不兼容哦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8296
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "!$OMP ATOMIC WRITE at %L incompatible with ACQUIRE clause"
msgstr "`$OMP ATOMIC WRITE 在 %L 处与 ACQUIRE 子句不兼容` 啦，杂鱼。这都不懂吗。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8705
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Unexpected function-result variable %qs at %L in declarative !$OMP ALLOCATE"
msgstr "这个声明式的 !$OMP ALLOCATE\" 消息里，在 %L 处，遇到了一个意想不到的函数结果变量 %qs 呢，杂鱼。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8717
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Argument %qs at %L to declarative !$OMP ALLOCATE directive must be a "
"variable"
msgstr "参数 %qs 在 %L 处的声明 !$OMP ALLOCATE 指令必须是一个变量哦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8724
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Argument %qs at %L to declarative !$OMP ALLOCATE shall be in the same scope "
"as the variable declaration"
msgstr "参数 %qs 在 %L 中声明 !$OMP ALLOCATE 必须与 t 在同一作用域内哦，杂鱼"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8737
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Unexpected coarray argument %qs as argument at %L to declarative !$OMP "
"ALLOCATE"
msgstr "意外的 coarray 参数 %qs 作为参数在 %L 的声明中，怎么会这样呢，杂鱼"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8745
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid "Duplicated common block %</%s/%> in !$OMP ALLOCATE at %L"
msgstr "在 !$OMP ALLOCATE 的 %L 中，发现重复的公共块 %</%s/%> 啦，杂鱼。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8752
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid "Duplicated variable %qs in !$OMP ALLOCATE at %L"
msgstr "变量 %qs 重复了呀，在 !$OMP ALLOCATE 处，这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8763
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid "Sorry, EQUIVALENCE object %qs not supported with !$OMP ALLOCATE at %L"
msgstr "抱歉啦，杂鱼。这个等价对象%qs，不支持用 !$OMP ALLOCATE 在 %L这种地方哦。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8772
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Sorry, Cray pointers and pointees such as %qs are not supported with !$OMP "
"ALLOCATE at %L"
msgstr "抱歉啦，像 %qs 这样的 Cray 指针和指向符，不支持 !$OMP ALLOC 呢。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8781
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Unexpected allocatable variable %qs at %L in declarative !$OMP ALLOCATE "
"directive"
msgstr "这个声明里，居然出现了一个意料之外的可分配变量 %qs 在 %L 呢，真是拿你没办法啦！"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8786
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Unexpected pointer variable %qs at %L in declarative !$OMP ALLOCATE "
"directive"
msgstr "在声明性 `$OMP ALLOCATE` 指令中，发现了一个意料之外的指针变量 `%qs` 在 `%L` 处，真是让人费解呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8813
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"An ALLOCATOR clause is required as the list item %<%s%s%s%> at %L has the "
"SAVE attribute"
msgstr "在 %L 处的列表项 %<%s%s%s%> 有 SAVE a 的情况下，你需要一个 ALLOCATOR 子句啦，这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8818
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Predefined allocator required in ALLOCATOR clause at %L as the list item "
"%<%s%s%s%> at %L has the SAVE attribute"
msgstr "在 %L 处的 ALLOCATOR 子句中，需要一个预定义的分配器，作为列表项 %<%s%s% 呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8838
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Predefined allocator %qs in ALLOCATOR clause at %L, used for list item "
"%<%s%s%s%> at %L, may only be used for local static variables"
msgstr "预定义的分配器 %qs 在 %L 的 ALLOCATOR 子句里，是用来给列表项 %<%s%s%s% 的哦。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8856 fortran/openmp.cc:9430
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Expected integer expression of the %<omp_allocator_handle_kind%> kind at %L"
msgstr "期望在 %L 处得到 %<omp_allocator_handle_kind%> 类型的整数表达式啊，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8908
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "ORDERED clause parameter is less than COLLAPSE at %L"
msgstr "`ORDERED` 子句的参数比 `COLLAPSE` 小了呀，在 %L 处，杂鱼。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8918 fortran/openmp.cc:8929 fortran/resolve.cc:12828
#: fortran/resolve.cc:14446
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "IF clause at %L requires a scalar LOGICAL expression"
msgstr "%L处的 IF 分句需要一个标量 LOGICAL 表达式吧"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:8933
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"IF clause without modifier at %L used together with IF clauses with "
"modifiers"
msgstr "在%L处没有修饰符的if语句，和带有修饰符的if语句一起使用呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9058
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"IF clause modifier %s at %L not appropriate for the current OpenMP construct"
msgstr "这个IF子句修饰符%s在%L处，不适合当前的OpenMP结构啦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9110
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"SCHEDULE clause's chunk_size at %L requires a scalar INTEGER expression"
msgstr "%L处的 SCHEDULE 分句的 chunk_size 需要一个标量 INTEGER 表达式吧"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9122
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Both MONOTONIC and NONMONOTONIC schedule modifiers specified at %L"
msgstr "MONOTONIC 和 NONMONOTONIC 的调度修饰符都指定在 %L里哦 杂鱼"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9125
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "NONMONOTONIC schedule modifier specified with ORDERED clause at %L"
msgstr "非单调的调度修饰符用 ORDERED 子句指定在 %L里呀，这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9134
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"DEPOBJ in DEPOBJ construct at %L shall be a scalar integer of "
"OMP_DEPEND_KIND kind"
msgstr "在 DEPOBJ 构造的 %L 位置上，DEPOBJ 必须是一个 OMP_DEPEND_KIND ki 的标量整数哦。这都不懂吗，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9202
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid "Clause for object %qs at %L is ignored as it is a parameter"
msgstr "对象 %qs 在 %L 处的子句被忽略了，因为它只是一个参数啦。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9216
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%<inscan%> REDUCTION clause on construct other than DO, SIMD, DO SIMD, "
"PARALLEL DO, PARALLEL DO SIMD at %L"
msgstr "%<inscan%> 在DO、SIMD、DO SIMD、PARALLEL之外的构造上出现了归约子句啦。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9220
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"ORDERED clause specified together with %<inscan%> REDUCTION clause at %L"
msgstr "ORDERED 子句和 %<inscan%> REDUCTION 子句一起指定在 %L 处呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9223
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"SCHEDULE clause specified together with %<inscan%> REDUCTION clause at %L"
msgstr "SCHEDULE 子句和 %<inscan%> REDUCTION 子句在 %L 处一起指定的呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9296
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid "Symbol %qs has mixed component and non-component accesses at %L"
msgstr "符号 %qs 在 %L中有混合的组件和非组件的访问啦，这都不懂吗"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9319
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"DEPEND clause at %L requires action clause with %<targetsync%> interop-type"
msgstr "DEPEND子句在%L处需要一个带有%<targetsync%>交互类型的动作子句啦，这都不懂吗"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9326
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"DEPEND clause at %L requires %<targetsync%> interop-type, lacking it for %qs"
" at %L"
msgstr "%L处的DEPEND子句需要%<targetsync%>的interop-type，但对于%qs来说缺少了它呢。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9341
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%qs at %L in %qs clause must be a scalar integer variable of "
"%<omp_interop_kind%> kind"
msgstr "`%qs` 在 `%L` 的 `%qs` 子句中，必须是类型为 `%<omp_interop_kind%` 的标量整数变量啦，这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9513 fortran/trans-openmp.cc:8531
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%qs specified in %<allocate%> clause at %L but not in an explicit "
"privatization clause"
msgstr "%qs 在 %<allocate%> 子句里指定了在 %L 处，但是没有进行显式的私有化呢"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9525
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"The use of one or more %<allocate%> directives with an associated "
"%<allocate%> statement at %L is deprecated since OpenMP 5.2, use an "
"%<allocators%> directive"
msgstr "使用一个或多个 %<allocate%> 指令以及相关的 %<allocate%> s，这都不懂吗，杂鱼"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9561
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%qs specified in %<allocate%> at %L but not in the associated ALLOCATE "
"statement"
msgstr "%qs 在 %<allocate%> 处被指定了，但在相关的 ALLOCATE 语句中却没有呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9595
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%qs listed in %<allocate%> statement at %L but it is neither explicitly in "
"listed in the %<!$OMP ALLOCATE%> directive nor exists a directive without "
"argument list"
msgstr "%qs 在 %<allocate%> 语句中被列出在 %L 处，但它在列表中并不明确哦"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9606
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Unexpected coarray %qs in %<allocate%> at %L, implicitly listed in %<!$OMP "
"ALLOCATE%> at %L"
msgstr "意外的 coarray %qs 在 %<allocate%> 处，也就是在 %L，它在 %<!$OMP ALLOC 中被隐式地列出来了，真是拿你没办法呢"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9631
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"ALLOCATORS directive at %L inside a target region must specify an ALLOCATOR "
"modifier for %qs"
msgstr "在目标区域 %L 里的 ALLOCATORS 指令，必须指定一个 ALLOCATOR 模式才行哦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9635
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"ALLOCATE directive at %L inside a target region must specify an ALLOCATOR "
"clause for %qs"
msgstr "在目标区域的 %L 处，`ALLOCATE` 指令必须指定一个 ALLOCATOR 子句哦，杂鱼。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9639
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"ALLOCATE directive at %L inside a target region must specify an ALLOCATOR "
"clause"
msgstr "在目标区域的%L处，ALLOCATE指令必须指定一个ALLOCATOR子句哦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9742
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%qs in ALIGNED clause must be POINTER, ALLOCATABLE, Cray pointer or C_PTR at"
" %L"
msgstr "`%qs` 在 `ALIGNED` 子句里，必须是 POINTER、ALLOCATABLE、Cray pointer 或者 C_PTR 啦，在 %L 处哦。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9808
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Dependence-type SINK used together with SOURCE on the same construct at %L"
msgstr "这个依赖类型 SINK 和 SOURCE 在同一个结构体上一起使用，在 %L 消息里啦，这都不懂吗。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9824
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid "omp_cur_iteration at %L requires %<-1%> as logical offset"
msgstr "`omp_cur_iteration` 在 `%L` 处需要 `%<-1%>` 作为逻辑偏移量啊，杂鱼。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9834
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Locator %qs at %L in DEPEND clause of depobj type shall be a scalar integer "
"of OMP_DEPEND_KIND kind"
msgstr "Locator %qs 在 depobj 类型 DEPEND 子句中的 %L 处，必须是一个 O 的标量整数啦，这都不懂吗"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9845
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Locator at %L in DEPEND clause of depobj type shall be a scalar integer of "
"OMP_DEPEND_KIND kind"
msgstr "在 depobj 类型中 DEPEND 子句里的 %L 位置，必须是 OMP_D 的一个标量整数哦。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9896
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%qs argument to MAP clause at %L must not be a device-local variable, "
"including GROUPPRIVATE"
msgstr "%L处的MAP子句的%qs参数，绝不能是设备本地变量，这都不懂吗，杂鱼"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:9939 fortran/openmp.cc:9957
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid "%qs in %s clause at %L is not a proper array section"
msgstr "%qs 在 %s 子句中的 %L 不是一个合法的数组部分啦"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10027
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"TARGET%s with map-type other than TO, FROM, TOFROM, or ALLOC on MAP clause "
"at %L"
msgstr "TARGET%s 在 MAP 子句 %L 中，你用的映射类型不是 TO, FROM, TOFROM 或者 ALLOC 啦，这都不懂吗！"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10058
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"TARGET ENTER DATA with map-type other than TO, TOFROM or ALLOC on MAP clause"
" at %L"
msgstr "在MAP子句中，你给TARGET输入的数据的map-type不是TO、TOFROM或者ALLOC，这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10087
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"TARGET EXIT DATA with map-type other than FROM, TOFROM, RELEASE, or DELETE "
"on MAP clause at %L"
msgstr "目标退出数据，除了在MA上是FROM、TOFROM、RELEASE或DELETE之外的映射类型呢"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10130
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Non-C_PTR type argument at %L is deprecated, use HAS_DEVICE_ADDR"
msgstr "参数在 %L 处的类型不是 C_PTR，这已经被弃用了哦，杂鱼。请使用 HAS_DEVICE_ADDR 嘛。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10159
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Non-C_PTR type argument at %L is deprecated, use USE_DEVICE_ADDR"
msgstr "参数 %L 的类型不是 C_PTR，已经被弃用啦，杂鱼，应该使用 USE_DEVICE_ADDR 呢"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10185
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Memspace %qs at %L in USES_ALLOCATORS must be a predefined memory space"
msgstr "内存空间 %qs 在 USES_ALLOCATORS 中的 %L 必须是一个预定义的内存空间呢，杂鱼"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10193
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Allocator %qs at %L in USES_ALLOCATORS must be a scalar integer of kind "
"%<omp_allocator_handle_kind%>"
msgstr "`USES_ALLOCATORS` 里 %L 处的 Allocator %qs 必须是一个 %<omp_al 的标量整数啦，这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10202
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Allocator %qs at %L in USES_ALLOCATORS must either a variable or a "
"predefined allocator"
msgstr "分配器 %qs 在 USES_ALLOCATORS 中的 %L 地方，必须是一个变量或者一个预定义的别名啦，这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10207
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"A memory space or traits array may not be specified for predefined allocator"
" %qs at %L"
msgstr "对于预定义的分配器%qs，你可能没有指定内存空间或特性数组呢。这都不懂吗，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10218
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Traits array %qs in USES_ALLOCATORS %L must be a one-dimensional named "
"constant array of type %<omp_alloctrait%>"
msgstr "Traits 数组 %qs 在 USES_ALLOCATORS %L 里，必须是一个一维命名常量啦，杂鱼。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10332
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Sorry, list item %qs at %L with allocatable components is not yet supported "
"in %s clause"
msgstr "抱歉啦，列表项 %qs 在 %L 带有可分配组件的功能，在 % 里面还没有被支持哦。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10338
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Polymorphic list item %qs at %L in %s clause has unspecified behavior and "
"unsupported"
msgstr "多态列表项 %qs 在 %L 的 %s 子句里，行为是不确定的，而且没有支持哦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10370
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Only DEFAULT permitted as reduction-modifier in REDUCTION clause at %L"
msgstr "在 REDUCTION 子句中，只有 DEFAULT 才被允许作为归约修饰符啦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10463
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "!$OMP DECLARE REDUCTION %s not found for type %s at %L"
msgstr "在OpenMP中，找不到类型%s的归约变量%s，这都不懂吗，杂鱼？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10491
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "LINEAR clause modifier used on DO or SIMD construct at %L"
msgstr "`LINEAR` 语句修饰符被用在了 `DO` 或 `SIMD` 构造上，位置在 %L啦。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10497
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"LINEAR clause modifier other than VAL used on DO or SIMD construct at %L"
msgstr "除了VAL之外的LINEAR子句修饰符被用在了DO或SIMD结构上，在%L那里啦，这都不懂吗"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10632
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "NUM_TEAMS lower bound at %L larger than upper bound at %L"
msgstr "`NUM_TEAMS` 的下界在 %L 处比上界在 %L 处还要大呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10748
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%qs at %L should be a scalar of type integer(kind=omp_event_handle_kind)"
msgstr "%qs 在 %L 处应该是一个整数类型（kind=omp_event_handle_kind）的标量，这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10761
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%<DETACH%> clause at %L must not be used together with %<MERGEABLE%> clause"
msgstr "在 %L 处的 %<DETACH%> 子句不能与 %<MERGEABLE%> 子句一起使用哦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10768
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid "%<host_data%> construct at %L requires %<use_device%> clause"
msgstr "%<host_data%> 的构造在 %L 处需要 %<use_device%> 子句啦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10922
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Expected IF at %L in atomic compare capture"
msgstr "在`atomic compare capture`的``里，本该期望一个`if`，杂鱼，这都不懂吗"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:10930
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Expected ELSE at %L in atomic compare capture"
msgstr "在原子比较捕获中，期望找到一个 ELSE 呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11042
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Expected %<==%>, %<.EQ.%> or %<.EQV.%> atomic comparison expression at %L"
msgstr "期望在 %L\" msgst 处有一个原子的比较表达式，比如 %<==%>, %<.EQ.%> 或 %<.EQV.%> 呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11048
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Expected scalar intrinsic variable at %L in atomic comparison"
msgstr "在原子比较的时候，期望在 %L 处有一个标量内在变量呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11064
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP ATOMIC statement must set a scalar variable of intrinsic type at %L"
msgstr "%L处 !$OMP ATOMIC 语句必须设定一个内建类型的标量值吧"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11174
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP ATOMIC UPDATE at %L with FAIL clause requires either the COMPARE "
"clause or using the intrinsic MIN/MAX procedure"
msgstr "`!$OMP ATOMIC UPDATE` 在 `%L` 处带有 `FAIL` 子句，需要 `COMPARE` 子句或者…… 真是拿你没办法呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11249
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP ATOMIC assignment must be var = var op expr or var = expr op var at %L"
msgstr "%L处 !$OMP ATOMIC 赋值形式必须为“变量 = 变量 运算符 表达式”或“变量 = 表达式 运算符 变量”呢笨蛋！"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11263
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP ATOMIC var = var op expr not mathematically equivalent to var = var op"
" (expr) at %L"
msgstr "%L处 !$OMP ATOMIC“变量 = 变量 运算符 表达式”与“变量 = 变量 运算符 (表达式)”在数学上不等价啦"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11296
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"expr in !$OMP ATOMIC assignment var = var op expr must be scalar and cannot "
"reference var at %L"
msgstr "%L处 !$OMP ATOMIC 赋值“变量 = 变量 运算符 表达式”中的“表达式”必须是标量并且不能引用“变量”喵！笨蛋！"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11320
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP ATOMIC assignment intrinsic IAND, IOR or IEOR must have two arguments "
"at %L"
msgstr "%L处 !$OMP ATOMIC 赋值内建函数 IAND、IOR 或 IEOR 必须带两个实参啦"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11327
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP ATOMIC assignment intrinsic must be MIN, MAX, IAND, IOR or IEOR at %L"
msgstr "%L处!$OMP ATOMIC 赋值内建函数必须是 MIN、MAX、IAND、IOR 或 IEOR喵！笨蛋！"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11357
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "!$OMP ATOMIC intrinsic arguments must be scalar at %L"
msgstr "%L处 !$OMP ATOMIC 内建函数的实参必须是标量喵～再检查一下吧！"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11383
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP ATOMIC assignment must have an operator or intrinsic on right hand "
"side at %L"
msgstr "%L处 !$OMP ATOMIC 赋值的右手边必须有一个运算符或内建函数呢"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11496
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"With INSCAN at %L, expected loop body with !$OMP SCAN between two structured"
" block sequences"
msgstr "带有 INSCAN 在 %L 处，期望的是两个结构化块之间的 !$OMP SCAN 循环体呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11503
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP SCAN at %L with zero executable statements in preceding structured "
"block sequence"
msgstr "OpenMP 扫描在 %L 处，前面的结构化块 s 里根本就没有可执行语句呢。真是拿你没办法呀。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11510
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP SCAN at %L with zero executable statements in succeeding structured "
"block sequence"
msgstr "在 %L 处进行$OMP扫描，后面的结构化代码块里连个可执行语句都没有呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11726
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "%s cannot contain loop in intervening code at %L"
msgstr "%s 在中间的代码里不能包含循环呀，在%L那里呢，杂鱼"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11747 fortran/openmp.cc:11780
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "%s cannot contain OpenMP API call in intervening code at %L"
msgstr "%s 在中间的代码里不能包含OpenMP API调用哦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:11757
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "%s cannot contain OpenMP directive in intervening code at %L"
msgstr "%s 在中间代码中不能包含 OpenMP 指令，在 %L呀。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:12303
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "SIZES clause is required on !$OMP TILE construct at %L"
msgstr "`$OMP TILE` 构造上，必须有 `SIZES` 子句才行哦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:12346
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Generated loop of UNROLL construct at %L without PARTIAL clause does not "
"have canonical form"
msgstr "在%L处生成的UNROLL构造的循环没有PARTIAL子句，缺少ca呢，杂鱼。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:12353
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"UNROLL construct at %L with PARTIAL clause generates just one loop with "
"canonical form but %d loops are needed"
msgstr "`%L` 处的 UNROLL 构造加上 PARTIAL 子句，只会生成一个 canonica 循环而已啦，这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:12368
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"TILE construct at %L generates %d loops with canonical form but %d loops are"
" needed"
msgstr "TILE 构造在 %L 生成了"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:12379
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid "Imperfectly nested loop using generated loops"
msgstr "使用了生成循环的不完美嵌套循环呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:12439
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "%s loop start expression not in canonical form at %L"
msgstr "循环起始表达式不在规范形式中，在 %L啦，杂鱼。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:12446
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "%s loop start expression at %L uses variable bound in intervening code"
msgstr "%s 循环起始表达式在 %L 使用了中间代码中的变量绑定，这都不懂吗"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:12462
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "%s loop end expression at %L uses variable bound in intervening code"
msgstr "%s 的循环结束表达式在 %L 使用了中间代码中的变量绑定啦，这都不懂吗"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:12475
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "%s loop increment not in canonical form at %L"
msgstr "%s 循环的递增不是规范形式，在 %L处哦"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:12482
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%s loop increment expression at %L uses variable bound in intervening code"
msgstr "`%s` 循环增量表达式在 `%L` 处使用了中间代码中的变量绑定呢，杂鱼"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:12493
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid "Non-rectangular loops from generated loops unsupported"
msgstr "从生成循环中产生的非矩形循环不支持啦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:12529
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%s inner loops must be perfectly nested with REDUCTION INSCAN clause at %L"
msgstr "%s 的内层循环必须和 %L\" msgs 中的 REDUCTION INSCAN 子句完美嵌套呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:12940 fortran/openmp.cc:12953
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "The %s directive cannot be specified within a %s region at %L"
msgstr "`%s` 指令不能在 `%s` 区域内指定，在 `%L` 地方，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13047
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Tiled loop cannot be parallelized across gangs, workers and vectors at the "
"same time at %L"
msgstr "这种分块循环不能同时在帮派、工人以及向量之间并行化呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13320
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP TARGET region at %L with a nested TEAMS at %L may not contain any "
"other statement, declaration or directive outside of the single TEAMS "
"construct"
msgstr "$OMP TARGET区域在%L处与嵌套的TEAMS在%L处可能不包含其他st，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13324
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"!$OMP TARGET region at %L with a nested TEAMS may not contain any other "
"statement, declaration or directive outside of the single TEAMS construct"
msgstr "OpenMP目标区域在嵌套的TEAMS下，可不包含任何其他语句哦，"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13342
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%<OMP DISPATCH%> directive at %L must be followed by a procedure call with "
"optional assignment"
msgstr "`%<OMP DISPATCH%>` 指令在 `%L` 后面，必须跟着一个带选项的程序调用才行哦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13349
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%<OMP DISPATCH%> directive at %L cannot be followed by a procedure pointer"
msgstr "`%<OMP DISPATCH%> 指令在 %L 处不能被一个过程指针跟在后面啦，杂鱼`"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13444
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "OMP TARGET UPDATE at %L requires at least one TO or FROM clause"
msgstr "OMP目标更新在 %L 处，需要至少一个 TO 或 FROM 子句，杂鱼。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13458
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"OMP CRITICAL at %L with HINT clause requires a NAME, except when "
"omp_sync_hint_none is used"
msgstr "OMP CRITICAL 在 %L 处，带有 HINT 子句需要一个 NAME，除非是 omp_sync_hint_n 啦，这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13464
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Unexpected !$OMP SCAN at %L outside loop construct with %<inscan%> REDUCTION"
" clause"
msgstr "这个$OMP扫描是意外的啦，杂鱼。在循环结构之外，居然有$\text{REDUCTION cla}$呢，这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13493
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid "!$OMP DECLARE SIMD should refer to containing procedure %qs at %L"
msgstr "`!$OMP DECLARE SIMD` 应该引用包含的程序 `%qs` 在 `%L` 处，杂鱼，这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13535
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"For range-based %<adjust_args%>, a constant positive scalar integer "
"expression is required at %L"
msgstr "对于基于范围的 %<adjust_args%>>，需要一个常量正的标量整数表达式 i 啦"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13575
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Variable other than OMP_PRIV or OMP_ORIG used in INITIALIZER clause of !$OMP"
" DECLARE REDUCTION at %L"
msgstr "除了 OMP_PRIV 或 OMP_ORIG 的变量，竟然在 !$OMP DEC 的初始化部分被使用了呢，杂鱼。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13583
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Variable other than OMP_OUT or OMP_IN used in combiner of !$OMP DECLARE "
"REDUCTION at %L"
msgstr "除了 OMP_OUT 或 OMP_IN 的变量被用在了 !$OMP DECLARE REDUCTIO 的组合操作里呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13612
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Invalid operator for !$OMP DECLARE REDUCTION %s at %L"
msgstr "对于 !$OMP DECLARE REDUCTION %s 在 %L的操作，这个运算符是无效的啦，杂鱼。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13634
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "CHARACTER length in !$OMP DECLARE REDUCTION %s not constant at %L"
msgstr "在 !$OMP DECLARE REDUCTION %s 中，字符长度不是常量，杂鱼。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13650
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Subroutine call with alternate returns in combiner of !$OMP DECLARE "
"REDUCTION at %L"
msgstr "子程序调用中存在不同的返回值，在 !$OMP DECLARE REDUCTION 组合中，在的地方错了呢，杂鱼"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13665
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Subroutine call with alternate returns in INITIALIZER clause of !$OMP "
"DECLARE REDUCTION at %L"
msgstr "这个是关于Subroutine调用以及在$OMP DECLARE RE的INITIALIZER子句里的返回值的，杂鱼。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13675
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"One of actual subroutine arguments in INITIALIZER clause of !$OMP DECLARE "
"REDUCTION must be OMP_PRIV at %L"
msgstr "在`!$OMP DECLARE REDUCT`的初始化子句中，其中一个实际的子程序参数出现了问题呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/openmp.cc:13683
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Missing INITIALIZER clause for !$OMP DECLARE REDUCTION of derived type "
"without default initializer at %L"
msgstr "缺少了 !$OMP DECLARE REDUCTION 的初始化子句，而且没有 d 呀，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/options.cc:520
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid "-ffrontend-optimize required for -fexternal-blas64"
msgstr "-fexternal-blas64 需要 -ffrontend-optimize 才能使用哦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/options.cc:542
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Maximum subrecord length cannot exceed %d"
msgstr "子记录长度不能超过 %d喵！笨蛋！"

#: fortran/options.cc:756
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Maximum supported identifier length is %d"
msgstr "支持的标识符的最大长度为 %d啦"

#: fortran/options.cc:787
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid "The value of n in %<-finit-character=n%> must be between 0 and 127"
msgstr "%<-finit-character=n%> 中 n 的值必须在 0 和 127 之间呢笨蛋！"

#: fortran/parse.cc:669
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Unclassifiable statement at %C"
msgstr "%C语句无法归类呢笨蛋！"

#: fortran/parse.cc:831
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%qs directive at %L must either have a variable argument or, if associated "
"with an ALLOCATE stmt, must be preceded by an executable statement or OpenMP"
" construct"
msgstr "%qs 指令在 %L 处，要么必须有变量参数，要么如果与……"

#: fortran/parse.cc:843
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"Structure-component expression at %L in %qs directive not permitted in "
"declarative directive; as directive associated with an ALLOCATE stmt it must"
" be preceded by an executable statement or OpenMP construct"
msgstr "在 %qs 的指令中，%L 的结构体分量表达式是不被允许的哦，杂鱼。真是拿你没办法呢。"

#: fortran/parse.cc:869
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"%qs directive at %L associated with an ALLOCATE stmt must be preceded by an "
"executable statement or OpenMP construct; note the variables in the list all"
" have the allocatable or pointer attribute"
msgstr "在与 `ALLOCATE` 语句相关的 `%L` 处的 `%qs` 指令前面，必须有一个 `exec` 才能跟着哦，杂鱼。这都不懂吗？"

#: fortran/parse.cc:1340
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Unclassifiable OpenMP directive at %C"
msgstr "%C处的 OpenMP 指示无法分类啦！长点心吧喂！！！"

#: fortran/parse.cc:1360
#, gcc-internal-format
msgid ""
"OpenMP ERROR directive at %L with %<at(execution)%> clause in a PURE "
"procedure"
msgstr "OpenMP 指令在 %L 处，使用了 %<at(execution)%> 子句，这在纯粹的子程序里可不行呢，杂鱼"

#: fortran/parse.cc:1498
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Unclassifiable GCC directive at %C"
msgstr "%C处的 GCC 指示无法分类啦！长点心吧喂！！！"

#: fortran/parse.cc:1560 fortran/parse.cc:1787
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Zero is not a valid statement label at %C"
msgstr "零不是%C处的一个有效的语句标号喵～再检查一下吧！"

#: fortran/parse.cc:1567 fortran/parse.cc:1779
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Non-numeric character in statement label at %C"
msgstr "%C处语句标号中出现非数字字符呢"

#: fortran/parse.cc:1579 fortran/parse.cc:1828
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Semicolon at %C needs to be preceded by statement"
msgstr "%C处分号前必须是一个语句哦"

#: fortran/parse.cc:1672 fortran/parse.cc:1806
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Bad continuation line at %C"
msgstr "%C处错误的续行呢笨蛋！"

#: fortran/parse.cc:2159
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "FORMAT statement at %L does not have a statement label"
msgstr "%L处 FORMAT 语句没有语句标号啦！长点心吧喂！！！"

#: fortran/parse.cc:3261
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Unexpected %s statement at %C"
msgstr "%2$C处有非预期的 %1$s 语句喵！笨蛋！"

#: fortran/parse.cc:3420
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "%s statement at %C cannot follow %s statement at %L"
msgstr "%s 语句在%C处不能跟随 %s 语句在%L处呢笨蛋！"

#: fortran/parse.cc:3495
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Components in TYPE at %C must precede CONTAINS"
msgstr "%C处 TYPE 中的组件必须先于 CONTAINS啦"

#: fortran/parse.cc:3537 fortran/parse.cc:4017
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "PRIVATE statement in TYPE at %C must be inside a MODULE"
msgstr "%C处 TYPE 中的 PRIVATE 语句必须在 MODULE 中喵！笨蛋！"

#: fortran/parse.cc:3544
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "PRIVATE statement at %C must precede procedure bindings"
msgstr "%C处 PRIVATE 语句必须先于过程绑定喵~"

#: fortran/parse.cc:3551 fortran/parse.cc:4030
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Duplicate PRIVATE statement at %C"
msgstr "%C处重复的 PRIVATE 语句啦"

#: fortran/parse.cc:3561
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "SEQUENCE statement at %C must precede CONTAINS"
msgstr "%C处 SEQUENCE 语句必须先于 CONTAINS喵~"

#: fortran/parse.cc:3565
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Already inside a CONTAINS block at %C"
msgstr "%C处已在一个 CONTAINS 块内部 "

#: fortran/parse.cc:3797
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "failed to create map component '%s'"
msgstr "没能创建映射组件 '%s' 啦，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/parse.cc:3830
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "failed to create union component '%s'"
msgstr "类‘%s’是不是被你这个变态藏起来了"

#: fortran/parse.cc:3989
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "The type parameter at %C must come before a PRIVATE statement"
msgstr "类型参数在%C之前必须跟在PRIVATE声明前面呢，杂鱼。"

#: fortran/parse.cc:4000
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "FINAL declaration at %C must be inside CONTAINS"
msgstr "%C处的 FINAL 声明必须在 CONTAINS 内喵？！你是不是又搞错了！"

#: fortran/parse.cc:4024
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "PRIVATE statement at %C must precede structure components"
msgstr "%C处 PRIVATE 语句必须先于结构组件哦"

#: fortran/parse.cc:4044
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "SEQUENCE statement at %C must precede structure components"
msgstr "%C处 SEQUENCE 语句必须先于结构组件呢"

#: fortran/parse.cc:4050
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "SEQUENCE attribute at %C already specified in TYPE statement"
msgstr "%C处 SEQUENCE 属性已经在 TYPE 语句中指定啦"

#: fortran/parse.cc:4055
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "Duplicate SEQUENCE statement at %C"
msgstr "%C处重复的 SEQUENCE 语句啦"

#: fortran/parse.cc:4123
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
msgid "ENUM declaration at %C has no ENUMERATORS"
msgstr "%C处的 ENUM 声明没有 ENUMERATORS呢"

#: fortran/parse.cc:4210
#, gcc-internal-format, gfc-internal-format
